{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43271","headline":"闰月定四时 · 杜周士","name":"闰月定四时","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"得闰因贞岁，吾君敬授时。\n体元承夏道，推历法尧咨。\n直取归余改，非如再失欺。\n葭灰初变律，斗柄正当离。\n寒暑功前定，春秋气可推。\n更怜幽谷羽，鸣跃尚须期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜周士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}